menu "Pocket Pal"

config POCKET_PAL_TIME_SCALE
    int "Active-time simulation multiplier"
    range 1 120
    default 1
    help
        Multiplies elapsed active time for development and hardware acceptance.
        Keep this at 1 for normal play. Values such as 60 let appetite, mood,
        energy, cooldowns, and the sad condition be exercised within minutes.

endmenu
